<title>USA: Ross Stores controller to resign.</title>
<headline>Ross Stores controller to resign.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Calif. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Stores Inc Tuesday said John Vuko will resign his position as senior vice president and controller in late March to join Douglas Broadcasting/Personal Achievement Radio as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it has a seasoned financial management team in place to effectively manage the business while it continues its active search to fill the position</p>
